<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>

  <!--
    Medicines+ (Papito.MedicinesPlus.AT, Workshop 2878860499): its drugs are ThingDefs with a recipeMaker in
    1.6/Defs/Drugs/, each giving one unit per lab craft. Values here are the lab recipe x 4 (batch of 4,
    ticks = lab work x 4 x 4), the rule VFE Factory's own drug bills follow. The fungus penicillin bill is
    AUTHORED (see the README). The Deep Pills infusions are in their own file.
    Every figure is a port of the source recipe unless the comment or the README says
    it is authored. Loaded only while the source mod is active (LoadFolders.xml). Not yet tested in game.
  -->

